  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Db"/>Now, Dear Lord, as we <chord name="Ebm7"/>pray,<br/>
      take our <chord name="Ab7"/>hearts and minds far <chord name="Db"/>away<br/>
      From the <chord name="Bbm"/>press of the world all <chord name="Ebm"/>around<br/>
      to your <chord name="Ab"/>throne where grace does <chord name="Db"/>abound.<br/>
      May our <chord name="Gb"/>lives be transformed by Your <chord name="Db"/>love,<br/>
      may our <chord name="Bbm"/>souls be re<chord name="Eb7"/>freshed from <chord name="Ab"/>above.<br/>
      At this <chord name="Db"/>moment, let people every<chord name="Ebm7"/>where<br/>
      join us <chord name="Ab7"/>now as we come to You in <chord name="Db"/>prayer.
      </lines>
    </verse>
  </lyrics>
